OL,3,GNEWSANew school gates divide parents as
OL,4,Aterm starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew black metal fencing and gates have
OL,7,Fbeen installed around Amhurst Primary
OL,8,FSchool in St Peter Port, prompting a
OL,9,Fsplit response from parents gathered at
OL,10,Fthe school gates.
OL,12,FSome called it a welcome extra layer of
OL,13,Fsecurity while others said it had
OL,14,Fruined the character of a school
OL,15,Fbuilding and the local area.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
