OL,3,GNEWSANew school gates divide parents as
OL,4,Aterm starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiz, a parent of a child said the
OL,7,Ffence, which was installed over the
OL,8,Fsummer holiday, "looks horrible, it's
OL,9,Fmore like a prison than a school" and
OL,10,Fsaid she preferred pointing the
OL,11,Fprevious ironwork fencing that remains
OL,12,Felsewhere on the site.
OL,14,FShe added: "This school is over 100
OL,15,Fyears old and they've messed it up
OL,16,Fhaving this up here."
